<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area Friday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers. No Sales reported following weekly movement of 85,200 head. Note - all cattle prices based on net weights FOB the feedlot after a 4 percent shrink.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None   Week Ago - 1,900   Year Ago - 1,300</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
